<title>USA: Noble Drilling to sell 12 rigs for $265mln.</title>
<headline>Noble Drilling to sell 12 rigs for $265mln.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noble Drilling Corp said Wednesday it has signed a definitive agreement to sell 12 mat supported jackup rigs to Pride Petroleum Services Inc for $265 million cash.</p>
<p>The sale will also include the hull of one former mat supported jackup rig with drilling equipment and machinery removed.</p>
<p>The closing of the transaction is scheduled for June 3, said the company, subject to routine closing conditions and the receipt of financing by Pride.</p>
<p>The company said that Pride will place $20 million in an escrow account payable to Noble Drilling if financing is not obtained.</p>
</text>
